    "response": "{\"reflection\":[{\"type\":\"miss\",\"reason\":\"The displayed sources show that participant experience is mainly driven by institutional procedures and formal paperwork. The evidence overwhelmingly suggests economic factors – lack of opportunity, peer influence, and hardship – as the dominant forces shaping participant decisions and behaviors, directly contradicting the claim's focus on institutional procedures.\",\"evidence\":[{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_cff1282c332ce672\",\"quote\":\"The reason why we do this kind of job is that currently there are no jobs in Kenya, this is the only option left for us and we cannot afford to steal from others since this job is the only opportunity we have.\"}\n]},{\"type\":\"unsupported_allegation\",\"reason\":\"The claim’s inference is unsupported by the provided evidence. The sources consistently point to economic necessity, peer influence, and practical considerations (like lack of masks) as primary drivers, not institutional procedures.\",\"evidence\":[{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_9b6bb456e6991740\",\"quote\":\"...people would really appreciate that kind of act. So, some people were happy and some took it as a show of pride and seeking attention.”\"},\n{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_59a0297c27baf69c\",\"quote\":\"Things are just okay”\"},\n{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_dc4b912ad21be979\",\"quote\":\"What majorly hindered us from studying was peer influence.”}],\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_cff1282c332ce672\",\"quote\":\"The reason why we do this kind of job is that currently there are no jobs in Kenya, this is the only option left for us and we cannot afford to steal from others since this job is the only opportunity we have.\"}\n]},{\"type\":\"no_change\",\"reason\":\"No new insights or flaws were identified beyond the initial assessment.\",\"evidence\":[]},{\"type\":\"no_change\",\"reason\":\"No new insights or flaws were identified beyond the initial assessment.\",\"evidence\":[]}],\"patches\":[{\"operation\":\"add\",\"target_rule_id\":\"\